{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 2, :comments ["<b>And they shall not profane My holy name.</b> For the offering comes only for My honor and the sanctification of My name, and one who brings it in impurity does not sanctify but rather profanes." "<b>Which they sanctify.</b> It refers back to both of them — 'and they shall not profane' [means] they shall not profane that which they bring and that which they dedicate to Me."], :book :leviticus, :voice :chizkuni, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-30T15:14:12.268488995Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}